      "width": 340,
      "content": "FLOW CONTEXT · Shopping (Purchased)\nSegmented: Purchased active w/ count.\nROWS: emerald checked checkbox → unmarkPurchased (returns to To Buy). Name struck-through gray-400 + 'Qty: n'.\nEMPTY: checkmark-circle icon + 'No purchased items.'.\nCTA: 'Update Pantry (N items)' floating bottom — only when purchased.length > 0. → updatePantry(): increments inventory qty for purchased items, removes them from shopping list.\nA11Y: 24px checkbox, 44px CTA.\nANALYTICS: shopping.unmark_purchased, shopping.update_pantry.",
