    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "wmt7e",
      "x": 2900,
      "y": 6094,
      "name": "Note / Server & sync",
      "metadata": {
        "type": "note"
      },
      "fill": "#717171",
      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
      "width": 340,
      "content": "FLOW CONTEXT · Settings (server & sync)\nSTATE: household has a server; this screen only exists in the self-hosted mode.\nROWS: Server (tap to change URL/token) · Status · Sync now · Disconnect.\nOFFLINE: 'Sync now' stays enabled but reports 'offline — will retry'.\nDISCONNECT: confirm first; local data stays, sync stops.\nCOPY: never say 'sign out' — there is no account to sign out of.",
      "fontFamily": "Inter",
      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontWeight": "normal"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "KEOoc",
      "x": 3370,
      "y": 6094,
      "name": "Note / Backup & restore",
      "metadata": {
        "type": "note"
      },
      "fill": "#717171",
      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
      "width": 340,
      "content": "FLOW CONTEXT · Settings (backup & restore)\nWHY: the only durability guarantee in a local install is a file the user owns.\nEXPORT: JSON (items, lists, logs, household) → share sheet / Files; no account required.\nIMPORT: restore replaces the current household after a typed confirmation.\nAUTO: weekly, on Wi-Fi, silent — surfaced here with the last run time.\nEDGE: export with zero items still writes a valid, restorable file.",
      "fontFamily": "Inter",
      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontWeight": "normal"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "w9NxdS",
      "x": 3840,
      "y": 6094,
      "name": "Note / Storage & data",
      "metadata": {
        "type": "note"
      },
      "fill": "#717171",
      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
      "width": 340,
      "content": "FLOW CONTEXT · Settings (storage & data)\nSHOWS: database size, item count, activity count — measurable, not a vague 'manage'.\nMANAGE: clear history (keeps inventory) · optimize (vacuum) — both reversible except history.\nDANGER: 'Delete all data' is separated, red, and requires typing the household name.\nAFTER DELETE: app returns to the mode picker; no hidden remote copy exists.\nOFFLINE: every action here is local and instant.",
      "fontFamily": "Inter",
      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontWeight": "normal"
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "fqIsR",
